{"text": "Geppetto lived. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In a small, poor room. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That got its light from under a staircase. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On the wall there was a fireplace. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But it was only a painting of one. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He picked up his tools. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I will call my puppet Pinocchio. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> This name will bring him luck. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He said to himself. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He carved the hair. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The forehead and then the eyes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To his surprise. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The eyes moved. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And stared right at him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Next he carved the nose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Which began to grow and grow. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The more Geppetto cut it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The longer the nose became. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When he finished the mouth. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It began to laugh at him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And stuck out its tongue. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then the puppets new hands. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Snatched the yellow wig. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> From Geppettos head. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You naughty boy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You are not even finished. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And you already. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Do not respect your father. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When Geppetto made the feet. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They kicked him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Right on the nose.", "alignment": {"characters": ["G", "e", "p", "p", "e", "t", "t", "o", " ", "l", "i", "v", "e", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "n", " ", "a", " ", "s", "m", "a", "l", "l", ",", " ", "p", "o", "o", "r", " ", "r", "o", "o", "m", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ",